ved using PostgreSQL and pgvector.","sessionId":"ses_0fae60061ffewNVfdg0kVd2yhG","subtitle":"Exploring PostgreSQL + pgvector episodic store implementation","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:04:42.589Z","title":"Read pg_episodic_store.py","type":"file_read"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mqv8qno6_103e73d27479":{"observation":{"concepts":["vector search","similarity thresholding","metadata filtering","episodic memory retrieval"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The retrieval function supports both embedding-based and text-based (query_text) searches.","Implements similarity thresholding using `min_score`.","Handles filtering of archived memories (`archived\": \"False\"`).","Retrieval logic extracts metadata including importance, recall_count, and decay_score."],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py"],"id":"obs_mqv8qno6_103e73d27479","importance":4,"narrative":"Read the implementation of the episodic memory retrieval logic to understand how memories are queried, filtered, and processed based on similarity and metadata.","sessionId":"ses_0fae60061ffewNVfdg0kVd2yhG","subtitle":"Inspecting retrieval logic in episodic memory store","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:04:42.950Z","title":"Read pg_episodic_store.py implementation","type":"file_read"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mqv8qo0i_7e6d8d2e7044":{"observation":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL episodic storage","Data persistence pattern","Asynchronous database access"],"confidence":1,"facts":["pg_episodic_store.py contains the `complete_decision_episode` method.","`complete_decision_episode` updates `decision_episodes` table with outcome, prediction_delta, and early_reextraction_flag.","The method requires an initialized PostgreSQL pool to function.","A `fetch_decision_episodes_since` method exists for retrieving historical episodes."],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py"],"id":"obs_mqv8qo0i_7e6d8d2e7044","importance":3,"narrative":"The agent inspected the implementation of the PostgreSQL 